  // and heartbeat (#268) — none of these three are queried on individually,
  // they exist for the fleet page and for operators diagnosing "which
  // process is this row". Not part of any uniqueness: a node can rename its
  // hostname or upgrade its CLI without becoming a different node, because
  // identity is `(createdById, name)`, not any of these.
  hostname   String
  platform   String
  cliVersion String @map("cli_version")

